abstract: "Frozen computational and source-attributed materials for development-stage ABCB1 efflux-risk assessment of ADC payloads and released species. Includes chemical identity, scoring, abstention, representation diagnostics, matched-count general benchmarks, and chemical-support reporting safeguards. These materials do not establish ADC-specific predictive accuracy or complete-ADC efficacy. Source-specific data licenses are documented separately from the software license."
